  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kiribati Australia Climate Security Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kiribati Australia Climate Security Initiative supports climate adaptation to enhance Kiribati&#x2019;s resilience to climate change. As a low-lying atoll nation, Kiribati is particularly vulnerable to the impacts of climate change. The initiative, which is being implemented by the UN Office of Project Services, delivers sustainable infrastructure and nature-positive coastal protection measures across South Tarawa.</narrative>
  </description>
